{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22016","headline":"读史五首 二 · 白居易","name":"读史五首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"祸患如棼丝，其来无端绪。\n马迁下蚕室，嵇康就囹圄。\n抱冤志气屈，忍耻形神沮。\n当彼戮辱时，奋飞无翅羽。\n商山有黄绮，颍川有巢许。\n何不从之游？超然离网罟。\n山林少羁鞅，世路多艰阻。\n寄谢伐檀人，慎勿嗟穷处。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22016.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22016","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}